# The stdio entry point. It is not a serverless function -- it has no default
# export and its top-level code connects to stdin/stdout. Keeping it out of the
# deployment stops any framework auto-detection from turning it into a lambda
# ("No exports found in module .../src/index.js"). Vercel uses api/mcp.ts.
src/index.ts
